codex
The failure is now isolated: this sandbox gives processes namespace-local PIDs while `/proc/<pid>` exposes a different PID namespace. Lean 4.22 resolves itself through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, which returns `ENOENT`; `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow, recorded runtime repair that redirects only that exact self-executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, leaving all other filesystem operations and Lean behavior unchanged, then rerunning preflight.
apply patch
